{
  "description" : "RelayEnvelope routing-metadata HMAC-SHA256 and its JSON wire form (default JSONEncoder: Date = seconds since 2001 as a JSON number, Data = base64, UUID = uppercase string).",
  "format" : "relay-envelope-hmac",
  "notes" : [
    "HMAC input = be32(len) || origin UTF-8 || be32(len) || (destination ?? \"\") UTF-8 || pool_id(16) || message_id(16) || maxTTL as 8-byte LITTLE-endian Int (always 5) || timeIntervalSince1970 as 8-byte LITTLE-endian IEEE-754 double.",
    "The two trailing integers are written with native byte order (withUnsafeBytes) - little-endian on every Apple platform; a port must hard-code LE.",
    "timeIntervalSince1970 is computed as (JSON timestamp, seconds since 2001) + 978307200.0 in f64; use timestamp_since_1970_f64_le_hex, do not re-derive from a decimal string.",
    "NOT covered by the MAC: ttl, hopPath (by design) and encryptedPayload. nil and \"\" destinations produce the same MAC input.",
    "verifyHMAC returns false when the HMAC is missing; comparison is constant-time (CryptoKit isValidAuthenticationCode)."
  ],
  "schema_version" : 1,
  "sources" : [
    "LocalPackages/ConnectionPool/Sources/Models/RelayEnvelope.swift"
  ],
